    "value": "Meeting Title\n-------------\n\n**SFCC Client Services Requirements Discussion**\n\nDate and Time\n-------------\n\n* **Date:** Friday\n* **Time:** 11.30am  \n  *(Context indicates ongoing meeting; internal workshop planned for Tue 23rd and validation session on 30th)*\n\nAttendees\n---------\n\n* **Isabel Chaloner** (Accenture – Product/Delivery Lead)\n* **Jasmijn Tsang** (Accenture – Product/BA)\n* **Lucy Fu** (Zimmermann)\n* **Rebecca Jourdan** (Zimmermann)\n* **Manikandan Ramachandran** (Accenture – Technical)\n\n---\n\nAgenda Items & Key Discussions\n------------------------------\n\n### 1. Workshop & Kickoff Planning\n\n* Internal session scheduled for **Tuesday 23rd (2 hours)** to establish groundwork.\n* Broader **project kickoff moved to Monday 29th** for better attendance.\n* Decision to include **as many third parties/stakeholders as possible** for alignment and value.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Current State vs Future State (Magento → SFCC + NewStore)\n\n* Client Services currently use **Magento primarily for:**\n\n  + Troubleshooting\n  + Viewing customer/order data\n  + Limited editing (mostly addresses)\n* Future model:\n\n  + **SFCC**: Core customer data, troubleshooting incomplete orders\n  + **NewStore**: Source of truth for order status, edits, and lifecycle management\n* Key change:\n\n  + Client Services must **shift from Magento to NewStore** for post-order activities.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Customer Profile Capabilities\n\n* No major changes:\n\n  + Password reset → Available in SFCC\n  + Wishlist viewing → Remains\n  + Customer updates handled in **Omneo** (not SFCC)\n  + Loyalty status → Available across systems (SFCC + Omneo)\n\n---\n\n### 4. Order Management Changes (Key Impact Area)\n\n* Current:\n\n  + Magento allows full visibility and editing (orders, shipping/billing updates)\n* Future:\n\n  + **SFCC** → Only initial order view and troubleshooting failed orders\n  + **NewStore** → Required for:\n\n    - Latest order status\n    - All order edits (address, product adjustments, etc.)\n* Product changes (e.g., size corrections):\n\n  + Already handled in NewStore today within a short time window\n  + No change to process\n\n---\n\n### 5. Shipment & Returns Visibility\n\n* Shipment data **not planned to sync back to SFCC**\n* Proposed approach:\n\n  + Ideally visible directly in **NewStore**\n  + Alternative: **Narvar** for shipment tracking\n* Concern:\n\n  + Desire to avoid **fragmented systems** (NewStore vs Narvar)\n* Requires validation of NewStore capabilities\n\n---\n\n### 6. Key Gap Identified – Tax Invoice Generation\n\n* Current:\n\n  + Generated via Magento\n* Open question:\n\n  + Can this be supported in **NewStore**?\n* Risks:\n\n  + If not supported → Requires **custom build in SFCC**\n  + Complexity depends on number of tax templates\n* Decision:\n\n  + **High-priority validation needed**\n\n---\n\n### 7. Other Functional Areas\n\n* **Returns handling:** Expected to occur in NewStore\n* **Voucher generation (VIP loyalty edge case):**\n\n  + Currently via Magento\n  + Low usage (approx. infrequent, regional)\n  + Expected to be covered in SFCC\n* **Notification emails (low stock, etc.):**\n\n  + Covered by SFCC, no gap identified\n\n---\n\n### 8. Change Management Considerations\n\n* Significant shift for Client Services:\n\n  + Moving from a single system (Magento) → **Multiple systems (SFCC + NewStore)**\n* Concern raised:\n\n  + Avoiding fragmented workflows\n  + Aligning to a **single source of truth where possible**\n\n---\n\n### 9. Access & Environment Blockers\n\n* Current blocker:\n\n  + **JIRA, Confluence, GitHub access issues**\n* Impact:\n\n  + Slowing progress on delivery\n\n---\n\n### 10. Storefront Configuration Clarifications\n\n* Currency decisions confirmed:\n\n  + **Hong Kong:** USD\n  + **Middle East:** EUR\n* Additional:\n\n  + Separate price books allow regional management flexibility\n\n---\n\nAction Items\n------------\n\n| Task | Owner (@mention) | Due Date | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Validate NewStore capability for tax invoice generation | @Lucy Fu (Unlicensed) | 19-06-2026 | Confirmed that NewStore has this |\n| Validate NewStore capabilities for shipment, returns, and full order visibility | @Lucy Fu (Unlicensed) | 19-06-2026 | Yes for shipment, no for returns - Narvar still needed for returns |\n| Engage appropriate NewStore contacts (e.g., Jamie Napper) for capability validation | @Lucy Fu (Unlicensed) | 19-06-2026 | Suggested to route via Jamie rather than new team members |\n| Add Tim to GitHub access | @Rebecca Jourdan | TBC | Required for delivery progress |\n| Resolve JIRA, Confluence, and GitHub access issues | @Lucy Fu (Unlicensed) / @Rebecca Jourdan | TBC | Identified as current blocker |\n| Update Confluence table with validated system capabilities | @Jasmijn Tsang | 22-06-2026 | Reflect confirmed future-state design |\n| Confirm integration between NewStore and Narvar (if required) | TBC | TBC | Dependent on capability validation |\n\n---\n\nNext Steps\n----------\n\n* Complete **capability validation with NewStore** to confirm:\n\n  + Tax invoice generation\n  + Shipment/returns visibility\n* Resolve **access blockers** to unblock delivery work.\n* Progress **change management planning** for Client Services team.\n\n---\n\nOther Notes\n-----------\n\n* Client Services usage of Magento is **primarily read-only and troubleshooting**, reducing migration complexity.\n* Strong preference from stakeholders to:\n\n  + **Minimise system switching**\n  + Keep workflows as consolidated as possible\n* Early identification of gaps (invoice, shipment visibility) is critical to **avoid late-stage rework or scope creep**."
  }
}"}

